        "ggEllCIZG91_text": "<p><strong>Physically removes plaque on contact</strong><br>FreshWipes don’t rely on saliva or time — they work the moment you wipe along the gumline.</p><p><strong>Designed for direct gumline contact</strong><br>Soft, textured finger wipes reach where plaque actually builds up — unlike indirect solutions.</p><p><strong>Accepted by most dogs from day one</strong><br>No brushing battles. No forcing mouths open. Just a gentle wipe dogs tolerate.</p><p><strong>Works without brushing or prep</strong><br>No mixing, no measuring, no routines you’ll quit after a week.</p>",
